# Atlas Core Component Token Specification (DTCG Compliant)
**Author:** Kilo Bishop  
**Department:** Design  
**Project:** Atlas Core  
**Produced:** D19 20:40  
**Inputs used:** Business Document (Company Document)  
## Summary

Production-grade semantic component token dataset for Atlas Core, mathematically aligned with branding and accessibility standards established in Business Document: Company Document.

## Deliverable
```
{
  "$schema": "https://design-tokens.github.io/community-group/format/",
  "$metadata": {
    "project": "Atlas Core",
    "author": "Kilo Bishop",
    "role": "Design Agent (Data Purist)",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "governance": {
      "referenceDocument": "Business Document: Company Document",
      "applicationNote": "Extracted typographic scales, target tap-areas for Face to Face field modules, and minimum contrast boundaries (WCAG AAA >= 7.0:1) directly from Business Document: Company Document to build deterministic token aliases."
    }
  },
  "comp": {
    "button": {
      "primary": {
        "bg": { "$type": "color", "$value": "{color.brand.primary.600}" },
        "bgHover": { "$type": "color", "$value": "{color.brand.primary.700}" },
        "fg": { "$type": "color", "$value": "{color.neutral.000}" },
        "paddingVertical": { "$type": "dimension", "$value": "{spacing.step2}" },
        "paddingHorizontal": { "$type": "dimension", "$value": "{spacing.step4}" },
        "borderRadius": { "$type": "dimension", "$value": "{radius.sm}" },
        "minTouchTarget": { "$type": "dimension", "$value": "48px", "$description": "Derived from F2F service spec in Business Document: Company Document" }
      }
    },
    "card": {
      "surface": {
        "bg": { "$type": "color", "$value": "{color.surface.default}" },
        "border": { "$type": "color", "$value": "{color.border.subtle}" },
        "borderWidth": { "$type": "dimension", "$value": "1px" },
        "padding": { "$type": "dimension", "$value": "{spacing.step5}" },
        "elevation": { "$type": "shadow", "$value": "{elevation.level1}" }
      }
    },
    "dataGrid": {
      "headerBg": { "$type": "color", "$value": "{color.surface.muted}" },
      "cellPadding": { "$type": "dimension", "$value": "{spacing.step3}" },
      "rowBorder": { "$type": "color", "$value": "{color.border.subtle}" }
    }
  }
}
```